        <p>AUDITORS AND OTHER APPOINTMENTS</p>
        <p>Me:srs. W Ford and J Harrison •vfire re-elected audi- tors; and Mr. Joseph Albinson ant Mr. T Critchky were pplinted representatives ot the club on the Liberal Executive. The following were also selected ax repre- s •ntatives of the club on the, Liberal Council : Maim. J Albinson, T Critchley, J Critcbley, J E Warren, A Jones.</p>
