        <head>COMMITTEE.</head>
        <p>THE COMMITTEE.</p>
        <p>The committee was appointod as follows :—Messrs. Joseph Albinsnn, Samuel J Beaman, William Bibby, Moe s Butterfield, Jam4s Critchley. Pctlr Delaney, Samuel Dunbobbin, Gaoree fi Shaw. R Wooda and John • Worrall. Mr. J. Critchley in place of Mr. Jeff Be.nnion is the only change.</p>
