        <p>At the WarringtTn Corn Market on Wednesday wheat fetched 3. 10d and 4s. per bushel, oats, 2s 3.1. Flour, best seconds, per 2401 b., 19s Bran is per 201 b. At the Provision Market prices were as follows :—Fresh butter, is 3d and Is 41 per lb ; cheee, GI to S I per lb. ; fresh eggs, for is. fowl, 44 Gd to 5 GI per couple; English beef, 4d to 91; mutton 6d to 10 1 ; veal,7d to 101 ; pork, Gd to 81.</p>
